text.paragraph:
No clinically significant differences in levothyroxine pharmacokinetics were observed between Tirosint-SOL administered 15 minutes and 30 minutes before a high-fat high-calorie meal (about 800 – 1000 kcal, 50% fat) [see 

                                    Dosage and Administration (2.1)
                                 ].

